        "evidence_id": "E001",
        "passage_id": "P001",
        "quote": "Order, Supreme Court, New York County (Manuel J. Mendez, J.), entered December 24, 2014, which granted defendants' motion for summary judgment dismissing the complaint, unanimously affirmed, without costs.",
